@startuml P330_mdoc_proximity_present_simple

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' Settings
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
'=== Header and Footer ===
header OPEN-DID Technical Specification
footer
  	Page %page% of %lastpage% at %date("yyyy-MM-dd hh:mm:ss")
end footer

'=== Title ===
title
	<size:25>mdoc Proximity Presentation</size>
end title

'=== Options ===
' Auto-numbering: ex) "<b>000." => pads with zeros to display a 3-digit number
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"
' Hide the participant box at the bottom of the page
'hide footbox

'=== Participants ===
<style>
participant {
  Padding 20
}
</style>
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 500
skinparam MinClassWidth 80

actor "**User**" as user
participant "**Wallet**\n(Holder)" as wal <<Wallet>>
participant "**mdoc Reader**" as rd <<App>>
participant "**Trust Agent**" as ta <<Server>>

box Trust Repository
    participant "**DID Document**" as BC <<Storage>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

== Preliminary : Trusted Issuer List ==

rd -> ta ++: Request trusted issuer list
return Trusted issuer list
rd <-> BC: Retrieve / respond issuer DID Documents
rd -> rd: Store list and DID Documents

== P330-1 : Device Engagement ==

user -> wal: Start proximity presentation
wal -> rd: Device Engagement (QR or NFC)

== P330-2 : Session Establishment ==

wal <-> rd: Connect transport channel and derive session keys

== P330-3 : DeviceRequest and Matching ==

rd -> wal: DeviceRequest
wal -> wal: Match stored mdocs

== P330-4 : DeviceResponse ==

wal -> wal: Generate DeviceResponse (deviceSignature)
wal -> rd: DeviceResponse

== P330-5 : Verification ==

rd -> rd: Issuer trust decision and signature verification
rd -> rd: Display verification result

@enduml
